msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TruthUnionLeftMembershipLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every left operand context belongs to the union result, preserving all contexts required for universal truth in both inputs."
msgstr "Chaque contexte de l’entrée gauche appartient à l’union, préservant les contextes requis pour la vérité universelle des deux entrées."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TruthUnionLeftMembershipLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
